<title>GERMANY: FIGURE SKATING-RESULTS OF NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-RESULTS OF NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>GELSENKIRCHEN, Germany 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Nations Cup Champions Series figure skating event on Friday:</p>
<p>Women's standings after short programme:</p>
<p>1. Irina Slutskaya (Russia) 0.5 points</p>
<p>2. Tara Lipinski (United States) 1.0</p>
<p>3. Olga Markova (Russia) 1.5</p>
<p>4. Mojca Kopac (Slovenia) 2.0</p>
<p>5. Vanessa Gusmeroli (France) 2.5</p>
<p>Pairs final result:</p>
<p>1. Mandy Woetzel/Ingo Steuer (Germany) 3.0 points</p>
<p>2= Marina Eltsova/Andrei Bushkov (Russia) 3.5</p>
<p>2= Kyoko Ina/Jason Dungjen (United States) 3.5</p>
<p>4. Kristy Sargeant/Kris Wirtz (Canada) 5.0</p>
<p>5. Lesley Rogers/Michael Aldred (Britain) 7.5</p>
<p>Ice dancing,  after original dance (tango):</p>
<p>1. Angelika Krylova/Oleg Ovsiannikov (Russia) 1.0 points</p>
<p>2. Shae-Lynn Bourne/Victor Kraatz (Canada) 2.4</p>
<p>3. Sophie Moniotte/Pascal Lavanchy (France) 2.6</p>
<p>4. Irina Lobacheva/Ilja Averbuch (Russia) 4.0</p>
<p>5. Margarita Drobiazko/Povilas Vanagas (Lithuania) 5.0</p>
</text>
